      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The output_log file of VRChat contains such logging entries. Search for \"[NetworkManager] OnPlayerJoined \" and \"[NetworkManager] OnPlayerLeft \" in the output_log_*.txt files and you'll find what you're looking for.\nA VRChat user even made a parser for this output_log file format to show who, when and for how long a user has been staying in a world you're in: https://nyanpa.su/vrchatlog/",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
