  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I believe user join history should be a feature added to VRC and an automatic feature in the game where it logs the name and time every user joins your world. Perhaps it can do this by in-game menu or file or bug-file within VRChat. I believe this is a good idea to help stop malicious users. I believe if we are given tools to combat malicious users and malicious custom clients, with evidence, we can fight back and make VRC the game we love.",
